---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeaderEn from '../../components/en/HeaderEn.astro';
import FooterEn from '../../components/en/FooterEn.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Notice | Etapel Official Site"
  description="Etapel Privacy Notice regarding the processing of personal data and contact channels."
  lang="en"
  ogLocale="en_US"
>
  <HeaderEn />

  <main class="bg-white">
    <section class="bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fbff_0%,#eef5fb_100%)] pb-16 pt-32 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-36">
      <div class="shell">
        <div class="max-w-4xl">
          <span class="section-kicker text-slate-700">Legal</span>
          <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-0.05em] text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
            Privacy Notice
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            Information about the processing of personal data collected by Etapel.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <div class="shell">
        <article class="surface-card max-w-5xl p-8 sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
          <div class="max-w-4xl space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-700 sm:text-lg">
            <p>
              Etapel, with address at California 167, Col. Parque San Andrés, Mexico City, ZIP 04040, Mexico,
              is responsible for collecting your personal data, the use given to such data, and its protection.
            </p>

            <p>
              Your personal information will be used to provide requested services and products, inform you of related
              updates, and evaluate service quality.
            </p>

            <p>
              For these purposes, we may request: name, landline, mobile phone, and email. If invoicing is required,
              we may also request company name, tax ID, tax address, contact phone, and email destination for invoicing.
            </p>

            <p>
              You have the right to access, rectify, and cancel your personal data, as well as oppose its processing or
              revoke consent previously granted.
            </p>

            <div class="surface-card-soft p-6 sm:p-7">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-slate-950">Contact channels</h2>
              <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-700">
                To exercise these rights, please call
                <a href="tel:+525556895055" class="font-semibold text-sky-700 transition hover:text-sky-800">
                  +52 55 5689 5055
                </a>
                or email
                <a href="mailto:ventas@etapel.com.mx" class="font-semibold text-sky-700 transition hover:text-sky-800">
                  ventas@etapel.com.mx
                </a>
                .
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-700">
                You may also visit California 167, Col. Parque San Andrés, Mexico City, ZIP 04040, Mexico.
              </p>
            </div>

            <p>
              Likewise, we inform you that your personal data is processed only within the country by authorized
              personnel of this company and is not shared with any other institution.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <FooterEn />
</Layout>
